# ImpactFeedAI — environment variables
#
# Copy to .env for local development:  cp .env.example .env
# Never commit real values. Every variable below is read directly by code in
# this repo (see docs/architecture.md for where each one is consumed).
#
# This project keeps a single .env so the app, the Prisma CLI and the scripts
# all read the same file. Note that Next.js also loads .env.local ahead of
# .env, while the tsx scripts load only .env — if you add a .env.local, keep
# the database variables consistent across both.


# ─── Database (Neon PostgreSQL) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Neon exposes two endpoints for the same database:
#   pooled  — hostname contains "-pooler."  (PgBouncer, transaction mode)
#   direct  — same hostname without "-pooler."
# Both need "?sslmode=require".

# The running application only (src/lib/prisma.ts). Set this to the POOLED url
# in every environment: serverless invocations open many short-lived
# connections, and the pooler is what keeps you under Neon's connection limit.
DATABASE_URL=""

# Everything that runs outside the request path:
#   - Prisma CLI / migrations        (prisma.config.ts)
#   - ingestion scripts              (scripts/ingest/*)
#   - maintenance / db verification  (scripts/maintenance/*)
# Always the DIRECT url. Migrations take advisory locks and the ingestion
# scripts hold long interactive transactions; both are unreliable through the
# pooler. Falls back to DATABASE_URL if unset, for single-URL convenience.
DIRECT_URL=""

# ─── Macro data sources (ingestion scripts only) ─────────────────────────────
# None of these are used by the running web app.

# Free key: https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/api_key.html
# Used by scripts/ingest/ for CPI / PPI / NFP / Fed funds release values and
# for the FOMC rate-decision walk. Without it the seed pipeline still runs
# (DataRelease rows fall back to hand-curated expected values), and
# auto-ingest skips its FRED and FOMC sources entirely.
FRED_API_KEY=""

# Optional. Free key: https://data.bls.gov/registrationEngine/
# Raises the BLS daily request cap from 25 to 500. scripts/ingest/sources-bls.ts
# works without it at low volume.
BLS_API_KEY=""
